  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study identifying support to waste sector in Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Study identifying support to waste sector in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med detta uppdrag &#xe4;r att identifiera m&#xf6;jliga ing&#xe5;ngspunkter f&#xf6;r svenskt st&#xf6;d till en avfallssektor, och om m&#xf6;jligt identifiera regioner/kommuner, institutioner, organisationer och f&#xf6;retag att arbeta med. Rapporten b&#xf6;r ocks&#xe5; identifiera olika s&#xe4;tt att utnyttja finansiella resurser f&#xf6;r detta arbete (dvs. genom att anv&#xe4;nda garantiinstrument)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this assignment is to identify possible entry points for Swedish support to a waste sector, and if possible, identify the regions/municipalities, institutions, organisations and companies to work with. The report should also identify different ways to leverage financial resources for this work (I e using guarantees instrument).</narrative>
  </description>
